{
  "$comment": "Which codebase-index harnesses a change needs: run-tests.mjs --changed. Paths are relative to the workspace root. A changed file that no glob here covers runs the WHOLE suite; skip lists only other servers and pure docs; none lists, one explicit path each, root files no harness loads. test:test-select fails when a suite script has no entry. Rules: scripts/lib/testSelect.mjs. impactHandler.ts, searchHandler.ts and docSection.ts are left out of @dist on purpose (the dist group lists every other src path one by one, so a NEW src file still falls to the whole suite): each is named only by the harnesses that call a tool it serves — grep the tool names in scripts/test/*.mjs before adding a harness.",
  "always": [
    "test:unit",
    "guard:no-llm-runtime"
  ],
  "skip": {
    "other server": [
      "postgres-mcp/**",
      "sqlserver-mcp/**",
      "observe-mcp/**",
      "bitbucket-mcp/**",
      "board-mcp/**"
    ],
    "docs": [
